h one of them will be granted any single wish they desire. However, as Homura's omen suggests, there might be far more to becoming a magical girl than Madoka and Sayaka realize... \n\n\n\nNotes:\n\n- Due to the 2011 Tōhoku earthquake and tsunami, the broadcasts of episodes 11 and 12 were delayed and were later aired as a double feature on April 21, 2011."],"ja":["魔法少女まどか☆マギカ",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-44353":"2022-12-08T17:19:03Z","serial-26898":"2020-06-17T09:49:25Z","serial-21514":"2020-01-21T00:10:35Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-44353","serial-26898","serial-21514"],"relatedMalIds":[11981],"availableEpisodeCount":12,"rating":8.39,"relations":[{"id":11981,"relation":"sequel"}]}]}